Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:49:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 06/14] GPU: VICTORY_SHADOW_HEAP=gpu_upload, indirect budget
 switch and usage log (HybridGt)

Title buffer copies in CPU-writable video memory instead of system memory:
an RTX 4070 Ti reads L0 at 8.5 GB/s and GPU_UPLOAD at 276 GB/s. Run11: no
device removal (runs 3-10 all had one), but CPU reads of the copies are
uncached and loading stalled until the title's watchdog fired.
VICTORY_INDIRECT_BUDGET (log2) and a log of each list's indirect work:
run10 never passed 2^20, so garbage arguments are not the hang.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
